<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br" data-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>REABITECH - Autenticação</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #050b14;
            --primary: #34d399;
            --text: #f1f5f9;
            --text-muted: #cbd5e1;
        }
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
        }
        /* Container Principal (100% da tela) */
        .auth-container {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        /* Lado Esquerdo (Branding) - 50% da tela */
        .auth-brand {
            flex: 1;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10, 61, 46, 0.9) 0%, rgba(5, 11, 20, 0.95) 100%);
            padding: 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center; /* Centraliza a logo e o texto */
            text-align: center;  /* Centraliza o texto */
            position: relative;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }
        
        /* Logo Gigante e Centralizada */
        
        .auth-brand img {
            width: 600px !important; /* FORÇANDO O TAMANHO AQUI */
            min-width: 600px !important;
            height: auto !important;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.5));
        }
    
        
        .auth-brand h1 { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .auth-brand span { color: var(--primary); text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.4); }
        .auth-brand p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 400px; line-height: 1.6; }
        
        /* Lado Direito (Formulário) - 50% da tela */
        .auth-form-side {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%);
        }
        
        /* Cartão de Vidro */
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        
        /* Inputs */
        .form-control {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 16px;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.25);
        }
        .btn-success {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            border: none;
            padding: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-success:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        /* Responsivo para Celular */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .auth-container { flex-direction: column; }
            .auth-brand { display: none; } /* Esconde o lado esquerdo no celular */
            .auth-form-side { padding: 20px; min-height: 100vh; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-container">
        <!-- Lado Esquerdo -->
        <div class="auth-brand">
            <img src="/static/images/logo-icone.png" alt="REABITECH" style="width: 150px !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; margin-bottom: 30px; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.6));">
            <h1>Reabilitação<br><span>em movimento.</span></h1>
            <p>Fisioterapia, psicologia e performance integradas em uma única plataforma multi-tenant.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Lado Direito -->
        <div class="auth-form-side">
            <div class="glass-card">
                {% block content %}{% endblock %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>